**Barriers.**
- **Prop G [elementary].** Slicing or density bounds that ignore arithmetic mod D lose at least
  ℓ = N^{1/(2k)} in PC_alg.
- **Prop P [hypothetical computation; relabelled after review].** The published two-linear-form bound
